  "_notes": "One Pro Controller per player. Handheld, dual Joy-Con and single sideways Joy-Con are not modelled: emulators (Yuzu forks, Ryujinx) fold them into the same input names. ZL/ZR are digital on real hardware. Positional mapping means Xbox A (south) = Switch B, as in the Yuzu/Ryujinx defaults; label-match swaps this. home on guide may clash with Steam's guide button; [VERIFY]."
